    <div class="capability">
      <div>
        <p class="capability-kicker">The right inspections reach the right people, on time.</p>
        <h3>Automatically dispatch the task assignment</h3>
        <p>LDAR, AVO, and Method 22 work dispatched by frequency, facility, and assigned personnel — whether staff or contractor.</p>
        <p>Survey frequencies are set per rule and per site; Assetas generates the rounds, routes them to the right role, and tracks completion against the schedule.</p>
        <ul class="label-rows">
          <li><span class="pill">Interval-driven</span><p>Monthly, quarterly, or semiannual surveys scheduled automatically by facility and jurisdiction applicability.</p></li>
          <li><span class="pill">Grouped</span><p>Work organized the way crews actually drive it — by area, route, or train.</p></li>
          <li><span class="pill">Role-based</span><p>Assignment to inspector, operator, or Air/EHS, with owners set by rule.</p></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <img class="cover-image" src="/static/img/ldar/pressure-gauges.webp" width="672" height="744" alt="Black-and-white close-up of industrial pressure gauges" loading="lazy">
