    <div class="capability capability--flip">
      <div>
        <p class="capability-kicker">The field, captured where the leak is.</p>
        <h3>Complete forms online or offline in Trek</h3>
        <p>Crews log findings at the component in Trek — with or without signal — so evidence is captured at the source, not reconstructed at the office.</p>
        <p>Each submission carries the leak ID, asset, component, submitter, and evidence, tied to the inspection. Records sync with original timestamps, video clip/photo, and coordinates when connectivity returns.</p>
        <ul class="label-rows">
          <li><span class="pill">No connectivity</span><p>Work offline where leaks live, typically in dead zones.</p></li>
          <li><span class="pill">Evidence at capture</span><p>Photos, readings, and geotag attached the moment the finding is logged.</p></li>
          <li><span class="pill">No duplicates</span><p>Completed work is removed from other assignees' lists in real time.</p></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
